WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
GUARDIAN: your earned pet, a different fighting style.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Watch the enemy intent. Guard protects your pet and prepares a counter.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
After blocking, Strike uses Counter Ready. Mirror and Thorn reward your defence.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Focus restores energy. Save your one-use Bubble Bottle for a dangerous turn.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Try this build in Training. Earn permanent equipment with Math Points. Reset talents free between battles.
